}
func cancelPickup(pickup: Pickup) {
    if let index = pickups.firstIndex(where: { $0.date == pickup.date && $0.location == pickup.location && $0.amount == pickup.amount }) {
        pickups.remove(at: index)
    }
}
func getPickups() -> [Pickup] {
    return pickups
}
```
In terms of economic feasibility and practicality, both of these solutions could be implemented with relatively low cost and effort. The mobile app could generate revenue through advertising or by offering premium features for a fee. The platform connecting businesses with waste management facilities could charge a small fee for each pickup scheduled. Overall, Swift can be a powerful tool for developing innovative solutions to address major environmental problems.

